        "description": "It was discovered that HTTP::Tiny incorrectly forwarded credential headers supplied by the caller, such as Authorization, Cookie and Proxy-Authorization, when following cross-origin redirects, including redirects from HTTPS to HTTP. An attacker could possibly use this issue to obtain sensitive information.",
